		column 'Service Group' = ```
				
				IF(
				    'Dim Service'[Region Name] IN {
				        "Regional Manager Central",
				        "RM Counties Manukau/Auckland",
				        "RM Midland",
				        "RM Southern",
				        "RM Northland/Waitemata",
				        "HD Southern Community"
				    },
				    "Health and Disability",
				    IF(
				        'Dim Service'[Region Name] IN {
				            "Housing - Central",
				            "Housing - Auckland",
				            "Housing - Midland",
				            "Housing - Southern",
				            "Housing - West Auckland & Northern"
				        },
				        "Housing",
				        IF(
				            'Dim Service'[Region Name] IN {
				                "HD Peer Services",
				                "Mind and Body"
				            },
				            "Peer Services",
				            "Other"
				        )
				    )
				)
				
				
				```
			lineageTag: 69ded8a0-5080-4208-b84c-71992df215db
			summarizeBy: none

